What are Women Menstrual Products?
Women Menstrual Products comprise essential personal care items designed for effective menstrual flow management while ensuring hygiene and comfort. The product range includes sanitary napkins, tampons, menstrual cups, and reusable alternatives like period panties. These products serve the critical function of absorbing or collecting menstrual blood while minimizing leakage and skin irritation. Contemporary innovations focus on eco-friendly materials, enhanced breathability, and ergonomic designs to improve user experience and meet evolving consumer expectations.
